flowchart TD
  S([Student question]) --> A[guard<br/>sanitise, redact PII, detect injection]
  A -->|blocked| B[refuse<br/>refused = true]
  A -->|ok| C[retrieve<br/>TF-IDF over the course index<br/>retry follow-ups with the previous turn]
  C -->|no passage above threshold| D[no_answer<br/>grounded = false, suggest closest lessons]
  C -->|passages found| E[generate<br/>LLM if configured, else extractive]
  E -->|model says INSUFFICIENT_CONTEXT| D
  E --> F[verify<br/>drop unsupported sentences, fall back to extractive]
  F --> G([Answer with citations<br/>grounded = true])
  B --> Z([End])
  D --> Z
  G --> Z
